        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_smoothsnake.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository bc890c97-d923-46e0-8c11-be0514855103).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. Your target is Rikki Badcock. While on the outside, she is just a normal barber, in the inside she has a random hatred for ducks and have been feeding any ducks she can find poisoned seeds which have caused health issues and sometimes, even death. Our client, who lost her pet duck from Baadcock wants to put an end to this duck killer. Good luck, 47.",
